2026-07-27T09:48:38.1762010Z i /tmp/RtmpMfkp3m/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:48:38.1762321Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:48:38.1762710Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:48:38.1763026Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:48:38.1763513Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:48:38.1764219Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:48:38.1765123Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
